<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0472_T04R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard some shady character\nsneakin’ around.\rIf he a thief, I’m gettin’ my\nDIGLETT. It bite ankles.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0472_T04R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We got robbed before. They took the\nTV, the microwave, and my dignity.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0472_T04R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DIGLETT: Dug dug.</language>
	</row>
</body>
